    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle of monster truck and monster car in stunt games begins. Welcome to the Demolition Derby Truck Stunts monster games. Monster truck simulator games are free monster car games. Monster truck games are full of strategy and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >immerse yourself In the world of monster truck racing games. improve your offroad mad truck driving skills in derby crash games. In these monster car driving games start your monster truck stunt master career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform stunts &amp; some awesome Monster Truck action in Car Games! Rev up your engines for truck race in racing games. There are many stunts of extreme monster truck racing. you will enjoy driving a fearless monster truck in this ultimate driving simulator.</p>",
